<title>SINGAPORE: Sembawang unit buys land for S$116.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Sembawang unit buys land for S$116.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified maritime group Sembawang Corp Ltd said its wholly-owned unit, Pyramid Hill Properties Pte Ltd, had agreed to buy two apartment blocks for a total cost of Singapore $116.4 million.</p>
<p>Sembawang said in a statement Pyramid Hill would redevelop the two blocks in central Singapore into a new luxury condominium.</p>
<p>It said the deal was subject to planning approval.</p>
<p>The purchases would not have any material impact on Sembawang's net tangible assets or earnings per share for the current year ending December 31, 1996, it said.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
